{"agent": {"state": {"session_id": "1789477601000-9be949", "summary": "", "context": [{"name": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "公司快递收发怎么管理比较规范？现在快递经常找不到。", "id": "7bcec222e0b24adba558b81fae004368", "created_at": "2026-09-15T13:06:41", "finished_at": null}], "role": "user", "id": "e5a47844e4b341e0ab14099e9fdd3447", "metadata": {"qwenpaw_tag": "external_user_query"}, "created_at": "2026-09-15T13:06:41", "usage": null, "finished_at": null, "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "Default Agent", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "理解用户诉求后，结合公司数据与制度作答，保持简洁准确。", "id": "31e6cf90040b4f18a5c9cdeb90a7092e", "created_at": "2026-09-15T13:06:49", "finished_at": "2026-09-15T13:07:21"}, {"type": "text", "text": "规范做法：\n1. 前台设「快递登记表」：到件时间 / 递单号 / 收件人 / 签收人 / 签收时间；\n2. 到件后企微通知收件人，**当日未取**下班前再提醒一次，存放不超过 3 天；\n3. 寄件统一走行政，部门月结，禁止私人件走对公账户。\n用一块白板按部门分区放件，找起来最快。", "id": "1222ee787ba6474f8fbb788797a70cd5", "created_at": "2026-09-15T13:06:49", "finished_at": "2026-09-15T13:07:21"}], "role": "assistant", "id": "da07cc89c2634f478af2cfac6e7e0cbc", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-15T13:06:49", "usage": null, "finished_at": "2026-09-15T13:07:21", "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "帮忙起草一条企微通知。", "id": "8e34649935104934ad9db9d36834d617", "created_at": "2026-09-15T13:11:41", "finished_at": null}], "role": "user", "id": "653bd961d5694d80ae63cef25b425e22", "metadata": {"qwenpaw_tag": "external_user_query"}, "created_at": "2026-09-15T13:11:41", "usage": null, "finished_at": null, "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "Default Agent", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "理解用户诉求后，结合公司数据与制度作答，保持简洁准确。", "id": "21a39ff12e364451a02bf58eada98cd6", "created_at": "2026-09-15T13:11:49", "finished_at": "2026-09-15T13:12:21"}, {"type": "text", "text": "【快递管理提示】各位同事：即日起前台快递实行登记+企微通知，请收到通知后当日领取；存放超 3 天的件将移至行政仓并需签字领用。寄件请一律经行政登记（部门月结），谢谢配合。", "id": "a8b31c2cb7ff4721a45b94498e4c1bad", "created_at": "2026-09-15T13:11:49", "finished_at": "2026-09-15T13:12:21"}], "role": "assistant", "id": "ae621efb566a4172a07233af26a36b50", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-15T13:11:49", "usage": null, "finished_at": "2026-09-15T13:12:21", "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "私人件走对公被查到怎么处理？", "id": "3cc4ff550b1243ce83c117ad3bd1717c", "created_at": "2026-09-15T13:14:21", "finished_at": null}], "role": "user", "id": "ebc9c1461e09430daf4cfced9203fe9b", "metadata": {"qwenpaw_tag": "external_user_query"}, "created_at": "2026-09-15T13:14:21", "usage": null, "finished_at": null, "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "Default Agent", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "结合公司制度与实际业务场景，给出可执行的答复。", "id": "52077e6187384cef8fa9dca420cf43cf", "created_at": "2026-09-15T13:14:27", "finished_at": "2026-09-15T13:15:06"}, {"type": "text", "text": "第一次提醒并补缴运费；第二次通报+运费双倍计入个人扣款。寄件人对公账户是税务合规问题，不是小事，通知里要写清楚。", "id": "4f67dbd5176342a29493bce431bdb735", "created_at": "2026-09-15T13:14:27", "finished_at": "2026-09-15T13:15:06"}], "role": "assistant", "id": "6239feffb7e54fc59e241e4b0ccd93e0", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-15T13:14:27", "usage": null, "finished_at": "2026-09-15T13:15:06", "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "登记表用什么格式？", "id": "b1644c4505134fa299945845d7a86da7", "created_at": "2026-09-15T13:17:06", "finished_at": null}], "role": "user", "id": "a6140cfdc75b4edf8ff6b52b4f56f098", "metadata": {"qwenpaw_tag": "external_user_query"}, "created_at": "2026-09-15T13:17:06", "usage": null, "finished_at": null, "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "Default Agent", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "结合公司制度与实际业务场景，给出可执行的答复。", "id": "e00a022b9b034a1c98a14628cb357dc7", "created_at": "2026-09-15T13:17:12", "finished_at": "2026-09-15T13:17:42"}, {"type": "text", "text": "双轨：前台纸质登记本（快递员自签）+ 每日下午行政把到件录成企微群通知。量稳定后直接换企微「快递管家」扫码入库，省一半人工。", "id": "158d608c9fc345a8893ac8102aa02ebb", "created_at": "2026-09-15T13:17:12", "finished_at": "2026-09-15T13:17:42"}], "role": "assistant", "id": "d4d02f0338b74642acef3fbcc198a24d", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-15T13:17:12", "usage": null, "finished_at": "2026-09-15T13:17:42", "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}], "reply_context": {}, "permission_context": {}, "tool_context": {}, "tasks_context": {}, "middle_context": {}}}}